{
  "$description": "The icons Usual Mail uses. Each name maps to one icon in Hugeicons' free set (@hugeicons/core-free-icons, MIT, Stroke Rounded). `npm run build` takes exactly these, for the web sprite and the Swift asset catalog. Names are kebab-case; Swift turns them into camelCase cases of UsualIcon.",
